cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AnnZarro, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: AnnZarro
abstract: >-
  A read-only browser viewer for AnnData in zarr (or h5ad) built around the matrices other
  viewers leave out: cell x cell kernels and distances (obsp) and gene x gene similarities
  (varp), explored one focused cell or gene at a time and linked to the cell x gene layers.
